WEBVTT

00:42.500 --> 00:46.963
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

02:35.905 --> 02:37.115
He's so handsome.

02:37.198 --> 02:39.367
He looks great in a suit.

03:12.734 --> 03:13.776
Who's that?

03:13.860 --> 03:14.861
Who's that woman?

03:15.361 --> 03:16.362
Is she his wife?

03:16.446 --> 03:19.407
- Is she Paik Sa-eon's wife?
- They look good together.

03:19.490 --> 03:20.325
Don't be nervous.

03:21.659 --> 03:24.078
Those people are looking at me, not you.

03:28.625 --> 03:30.585
Sure, they might be curious about you.

03:31.878 --> 03:32.712
But remember,

03:32.795 --> 03:37.800
there can't be any misunderstandings,
interest, or rumors

03:37.884 --> 03:39.886
about our relationship tonight.

03:42.013 --> 03:42.847
Let's go.

04:00.448 --> 04:01.324
A DAY BEFORE

04:01.407 --> 04:04.452
Heavy rainfall is expected nationwide
this year once again.

04:04.535 --> 04:06.704
With the monsoon season approaching,

04:06.788 --> 04:10.208
we must prepare in advance
for landslides, heavy rain, and typhoons.

04:11.376 --> 04:13.336
- Experts have pointed out…
- What's that?

04:13.419 --> 04:14.754
What's wrong with that?

04:14.837 --> 04:17.632
While unexpected damage is inevitable…

04:17.715 --> 04:18.716
I think there's a lag.

04:18.800 --> 04:21.636
How can it stop there?
It looks like she's cursing!

04:21.719 --> 04:23.972
Inspections need to be strengthened.

04:24.055 --> 04:25.932
Na You-ri, pass it over to the scene!

04:26.015 --> 04:28.268
We aim to review
last year's landslide site

04:28.351 --> 04:30.895
and consider ways to reduce damage.

04:30.979 --> 04:32.522
Reporter Park is on-site now.

04:41.614 --> 04:42.573
This means…

04:43.908 --> 04:44.993
a mountain, right?

04:46.077 --> 04:47.537
The high middle mountain?

04:49.872 --> 04:51.040
You did great.

04:53.710 --> 04:54.961
I'll be honest.

04:55.044 --> 04:58.089
Director Yoon's a superior,
but I can't stand how rude he is.

04:58.172 --> 04:59.424
You really showed him

04:59.924 --> 05:00.758
the peak.

05:01.968 --> 05:04.345
I mean, the high mountain.

05:05.555 --> 05:07.265
What the hell are you doing?

05:07.348 --> 05:09.600
Put up the apology message now!

05:09.684 --> 05:11.269
- Darn it.
- Okay!

05:11.352 --> 05:13.104
…roads have collapsed.

05:13.187 --> 05:14.480
WE APOLOGIZE FOR THE DISRUPTION

05:14.564 --> 05:16.899
Places with heavy traffic
were no exception…

05:16.983 --> 05:18.901
- Breaking news on the abduction incident.
- What?

05:18.985 --> 05:20.903
The emergency briefing is in five minutes.

05:21.446 --> 05:22.405
But…

05:23.114 --> 05:24.324
OFFICE OF THE PRESIDENT

05:34.792 --> 05:37.587
You-ri, breaking news
from the Presidential Office.

05:38.463 --> 05:39.922
A spokesperson briefing?

05:41.174 --> 05:43.342
I keep seeing Sa-eon today.

05:45.803 --> 05:47.472
Hee-joo, we're going live.

05:47.555 --> 05:50.141
- Can you interpret--
- No interpreter. Tell her to go.

05:50.224 --> 05:52.977
That's all for today. You may leave.
Great work.

06:03.154 --> 06:05.948
They keep having the spokesperson do it.

06:06.032 --> 06:08.659
Don't the Chief Security Officer
or Foreign Ministry

06:08.743 --> 06:11.329
usually take turns briefing
for situations like this?

06:11.412 --> 06:12.497
They did.

06:12.580 --> 06:13.581
- They did?
- Yeah.

06:13.664 --> 06:16.292
When the abduction happened.
You don't remember, do you?

06:16.375 --> 06:19.253
That's why they keep
sending out Paik Sa-eon.

06:19.337 --> 06:22.924
Paik Sa-eon overshadows
the Foreign Ministry and the ministers.

06:23.007 --> 06:24.884
Hey, I think he's coming out.

06:28.721 --> 06:30.264
OFFICE OF THE PRESIDENT

06:44.904 --> 06:47.907
I'm Paik Sa-eon, spokesperson
for the Presidential Office.

06:48.741 --> 06:52.286
Today, from 1:48 p.m. to 4:20 p.m.

06:52.370 --> 06:55.498
- Korea Standard Time…
- Good vocalization and a great voice.

06:55.581 --> 06:57.333
What was he like as a news anchor?

06:57.416 --> 06:58.543
The same as he is now.

06:58.626 --> 07:02.130
He ranked first in preference,
trust, and ratings.

07:02.213 --> 07:03.464
Excuse me.

07:04.841 --> 07:07.593
Can you please be quiet?

07:08.427 --> 07:10.847
I can't hear Sa-eon's voice well
because of you.

07:13.307 --> 07:15.893
Being a fangirl even while she's working.

07:15.977 --> 07:18.104
We have made our utmost efforts.

07:18.896 --> 07:20.606
However, the armed group demands

07:20.690 --> 07:23.276
the immediate withdrawal
of South Korean Troops

07:23.359 --> 07:25.486
and payment of a ransom,

07:25.570 --> 07:28.364
warning that they will kill the hostages

07:28.448 --> 07:30.575
if their demands are not met.

07:30.658 --> 07:31.492
- Kill?
- Kill?

07:35.496 --> 07:38.416
I would like to state
the government's position on this.

07:41.169 --> 07:44.589
When it comes to negotiations with
the kidnappers regarding the ransom…

07:49.886 --> 07:50.887
There will be none.

07:52.972 --> 07:56.726
The government considers their acts
as inhumane crimes

07:56.809 --> 07:59.353
that cannot be tolerated

07:59.437 --> 08:01.606
and will never compromise.

08:01.689 --> 08:05.651
We promise to mobilize all
national resources to rescue our citizens,

08:05.735 --> 08:09.363
including cooperation
with international organizations.

08:10.740 --> 08:15.328
We will never compromise
on the principles we must uphold.

08:15.411 --> 08:18.247
Furthermore, the government
will use this opportunity

08:18.331 --> 08:20.666
to address the recent attacks

08:20.750 --> 08:23.794
on third-country commercial vessels
in the Strait of Surmuz.

08:23.878 --> 08:26.797
The illegal use of force
in international waters,

08:26.881 --> 08:30.051
where the freedom of navigation
for vessels is guaranteed,

08:30.134 --> 08:32.261
is viewed as a serious concern.

08:32.845 --> 08:34.263
In the future,

08:34.347 --> 08:36.974
the government will strengthen
safety guidance activities

08:37.058 --> 08:39.018
for citizens in high-risk areas

08:39.101 --> 08:42.730
and implement measures
to prevent similar incidents

08:42.813 --> 08:45.024
from occurring in the future.

08:59.372 --> 09:00.831
As of 5:02 p.m.,

09:00.915 --> 09:03.543
a temporary media control
will be implemented

09:03.626 --> 09:05.628
under government authority.

09:05.711 --> 09:07.004
- An embargo?
- Again?

09:07.088 --> 09:08.798
Why are they trying to silence us?

09:09.924 --> 09:10.758
Excuse me?

09:12.468 --> 09:13.636
HBC, Jang Hyeok-jin.

09:15.096 --> 09:17.014
Foreign media are already reporting this.

09:17.598 --> 09:19.308
If our media stay silent,

09:19.392 --> 09:20.768
sensational fake news

09:20.851 --> 09:24.230
and unreliable personal broadcasts
will take over.

09:25.106 --> 09:26.440
Is that okay with you?

09:28.401 --> 09:29.235
Yes.

09:30.361 --> 09:31.195
Excuse me?

09:32.863 --> 09:37.535
Aren't reporters from our country's
leading media outlets all here?

09:37.618 --> 09:39.704
If you don't mislead public opinion,

09:39.787 --> 09:43.666
the citizens won't believe
what fake news says.

09:46.043 --> 09:47.378
Be honest with us.

09:48.254 --> 09:51.007
The current situation is bad, isn't it?

09:51.841 --> 09:53.968
"Don't be gentle with the government."

09:54.051 --> 09:56.596
You've come this far with that saying,

09:57.305 --> 10:00.433
but I've never seen you
look so scared before.

10:03.561 --> 10:04.604
Yes.

10:05.980 --> 10:07.940
I'm terrified right now.

10:09.483 --> 10:12.778
But am I the only one here
who is scared?

10:17.658 --> 10:20.786
I ask all of the journalists here today.

10:21.370 --> 10:22.663
Come together as one

10:23.331 --> 10:26.375
and pray for the safe return
of our citizens.

10:26.959 --> 10:28.502
I promise that the government

10:28.586 --> 10:33.049
will do its utmost to ensure
not a single life is lost.

10:38.012 --> 10:40.681
Check major headlines,
personal broadcasts, new media,

10:40.765 --> 10:42.266
and comments on community posts.

10:42.350 --> 10:44.393
- Report public opinion to me.
- Yes, sir.

10:44.477 --> 10:46.520
Post live updates
from the negotiation team.

10:46.604 --> 10:47.438
Yes, sir.

10:57.239 --> 10:59.617
SINIL DAILY NEWS,
DONGYUL DAILY NEWS, DAILY TAEJIN

11:05.122 --> 11:06.540
SINIL DAILY NEWS LEE YEONG-JIN

11:09.043 --> 11:09.960
MBS HA JOO-WON

11:14.006 --> 11:15.216
MBS HA JOO-WON

11:15.299 --> 11:17.051
SINIL DAILY NEWS LEE YEONG-JIN

11:19.637 --> 11:21.138
SINIL DAILY NEWS LEE YEONG-JIN

11:26.227 --> 11:27.061
HBC NA YOU-RI

11:27.144 --> 11:28.938
Sa-eon, it's You-ri.

11:29.021 --> 11:30.815
I'm rooting for you! Stay strong!

11:46.372 --> 11:47.206
It's time…

11:49.708 --> 11:51.710
you quit working.

11:53.087 --> 11:56.132
You know the election camp
starts in a month, right?

11:56.882 --> 11:58.384
Put aside external activities.

11:59.176 --> 12:00.553
Focus on supporting him.

12:01.137 --> 12:02.388
Of course.

12:02.471 --> 12:04.515
I was going to ask her to quit anyway.

12:04.598 --> 12:06.809
She never should've started working.

12:07.726 --> 12:11.605
Last year, you suddenly
went on about not being able to breathe.

12:11.689 --> 12:15.067
So I guess he let you work
to give you room to breathe.

12:16.068 --> 12:18.487
But exposing your name
and face was something

12:19.113 --> 12:20.990
that should have never happened.

12:22.366 --> 12:23.701
Put an end to it quickly.

12:24.660 --> 12:25.744
Also,

12:26.704 --> 12:30.708
is there no improvement
in your selective mutism?

12:32.209 --> 12:34.753
Is there really a need for improvement?

12:40.217 --> 12:42.678
It's probably better
to keep her mouth shut.

12:46.765 --> 12:48.225
Don't worry, ma'am.

12:48.309 --> 12:50.978
I'll make sure nothing interferes
with the election…

12:51.854 --> 12:52.980
God, that bitch.

12:54.815 --> 12:57.359
I need to put that hag in her place
one day.

12:57.443 --> 12:59.195
This is all your fault!

13:00.696 --> 13:04.241
If you stole someone else's man,
you should do a better job!

13:04.992 --> 13:07.745
You haven't even been
able to win your man's heart.

13:10.706 --> 13:13.459
Who do you take after?
It certainly isn't me.

13:13.542 --> 13:16.253
Don't forget, you're Chungwoon Daily News
chairman's second daughter

13:16.337 --> 13:18.214
and the future president's
daughter-in-law.

13:46.283 --> 13:49.370
HANNAM-DONG, SIGN LANGUAGE CENTER
PYEONGCHANG-DONG, BROADCAST CENTER

13:56.877 --> 13:58.504
HANNAM-DONG

14:21.193 --> 14:22.361
In an emergency briefing,

14:22.444 --> 14:25.948
the government stated that it will
not compromise despite threats

14:26.031 --> 14:27.700
from the Argan armed group--

14:27.783 --> 14:31.203
…no compromise…

14:31.954 --> 14:35.624
Also, there will be no negotiations…

14:38.127 --> 14:41.797
You've gone off-route.

14:41.881 --> 14:43.549
You've gone off-route.

15:01.275 --> 15:02.693
You've gone off-route.

15:57.706 --> 15:59.249
…kill the hostage…

16:00.501 --> 16:01.877
…the armed group…

16:02.795 --> 16:03.837
…ransom…

16:03.921 --> 16:05.297
…strongly suggested…

16:05.381 --> 16:06.715
…no compromise…

16:07.675 --> 16:08.759
…do its utmost…

16:08.842 --> 16:10.094
…kill the hostage…

16:11.303 --> 16:12.262
…strongly…

16:13.263 --> 16:14.223
…kill…

16:14.306 --> 16:17.226
There will be no negotiation
unless the ransom is paid…

16:18.560 --> 16:21.355
The engine of an unattended car
starts on its own.

16:21.438 --> 16:23.565
The doors lock and unlock.

16:24.191 --> 16:27.111
Malware is implanted
in the vehicle's navigation software.

16:27.194 --> 16:30.614
It's car hacking, where someone
manipulates another person's vehicle.

16:30.698 --> 16:33.158
HACKED NAVIGATION SYSTEM
MANIPULATES ENGINE AND LOCKS

17:02.187 --> 17:04.773
Monitoring results show no signs

17:04.857 --> 17:08.610
of journalists breaking
embargo agreements…

17:10.446 --> 17:12.489
- Mr. Paik?
- What about new media?

17:12.573 --> 17:15.284
Yes, we've reviewed everything there too.

17:15.868 --> 17:17.119
It's a mess.

17:17.202 --> 17:20.539
Netizens have uncovered
your hidden background,

17:20.622 --> 17:24.543
including FBI training
and NYPD hostage negotiation courses.

17:24.626 --> 17:26.712
You're a negotiation expert.

17:26.795 --> 17:29.673
They want you to be sent
to the negotiation team.

17:29.757 --> 17:32.509
It's a mess… What? Excuse me.

17:32.593 --> 17:36.764
So, after a comprehensive review,

17:36.847 --> 17:40.684
it appears that there are no speculative
articles or malicious reports…

17:40.768 --> 17:41.977
There is.

17:42.728 --> 17:43.645
Excuse me?

17:44.605 --> 17:47.691
A very malicious report
that distorts the facts.

17:47.775 --> 17:48.901
Where?

17:48.984 --> 17:50.861
Here. Take care of it.

17:55.991 --> 17:56.825
What is this?

18:02.247 --> 18:04.166
What? Come on.

18:04.249 --> 18:07.419
Jang Hyeok-jin from HBC is at it again.

18:07.503 --> 18:08.337
Yeah.

18:09.213 --> 18:12.257
He seems friendly,
but then he throws in a curveball.

18:12.341 --> 18:13.175
But…

18:15.219 --> 18:17.471
what do we say when we request a deletion?

18:17.554 --> 18:19.264
Emotional distress

18:19.348 --> 18:21.266
caused by malicious distortion?

18:21.350 --> 18:22.392
Hysteria?

18:22.476 --> 18:23.852
- Hysteria?
- Hysteria.

18:23.936 --> 18:24.853
Hysteria?

18:29.525 --> 18:32.194
TAESAN DAILY NEWS
SOCIAL AFFAIRS EDITOR KIM HYEON-WOO

19:54.526 --> 19:56.320
This is the negotiation team's timeline.

20:03.994 --> 20:05.954
- You got a call.
- Who is it this time?

20:08.540 --> 20:09.583
A strange number.

20:10.167 --> 20:11.418
I think it's from abroad.

20:13.295 --> 20:14.129
What shall I do?

20:21.345 --> 20:22.554
Paik Sa-eon speaking.

20:25.224 --> 20:26.308
Please speak.

20:30.520 --> 20:33.106
- I'll hang up if you don't.
- Paik Sa-eon.

20:36.235 --> 20:39.154
So it is really you.

20:39.947 --> 20:40.781
What is this?

20:41.448 --> 20:45.160
What? You don't like my voice?

20:47.120 --> 20:47.955
Where are you?

20:48.997 --> 20:50.707
It's not a domestic number.

20:50.791 --> 20:52.167
Who are you affiliated with?

20:52.251 --> 20:54.211
I'll kill…

20:54.711 --> 20:56.964
I'm going to kill

20:57.547 --> 20:58.799
your wife.

21:05.430 --> 21:07.015
The voice just now…

21:07.099 --> 21:08.016
Get back to work.

21:09.768 --> 21:10.602
Yes, sir.

21:15.315 --> 21:16.149
MOTHER

21:19.194 --> 21:20.279
It's me.

21:20.362 --> 21:22.114
Did you see her today?

21:23.073 --> 21:25.409
What time did you part ways?

21:29.663 --> 21:31.081
With my mother-in-law?

21:31.164 --> 21:32.791
SON-IN-LAW

21:33.792 --> 21:34.626
What?

21:35.877 --> 21:37.713
Goodness. It's my son-in-law.

21:37.796 --> 21:39.172
I thought you were busy.

21:39.798 --> 21:43.802
Your face is on every channel today.

21:44.511 --> 21:46.471
My son-in-law looks amazing on screen.

21:47.889 --> 21:49.766
What? Hee-joo?

21:50.475 --> 21:53.520
Yeah, I brought her home.
I'll send her off after dinner.

21:53.603 --> 21:55.480
Is that so?

21:56.106 --> 21:57.482
Okay, have a good night.

22:03.030 --> 22:04.406
- Mr. Kang?
- Yes, sir?

22:04.489 --> 22:07.326
406-000-1290. Trace this number for me.

22:07.409 --> 22:08.994
- What?
- Did you memorize it?

22:09.786 --> 22:11.955
- It's a phishing scam.
- Four, zero…

22:12.039 --> 22:15.042
406-000-1290. I'll trace it.

22:15.751 --> 22:17.794
Yeah, okay. You do that.

22:17.878 --> 22:20.339
Former journalists
really are a different breed.

22:21.298 --> 22:22.299
They're fast.

22:35.896 --> 22:36.897
Is she dead?

22:40.358 --> 22:41.610
You said you'd kill her.

22:42.778 --> 22:43.653
Did you kill her?

22:46.114 --> 22:47.824
Do you even know who my wife is?

22:49.451 --> 22:50.744
Look here.

22:51.286 --> 22:52.829
Don't you watch the news?

22:53.872 --> 22:58.668
I'm far too busy
for these types of prank calls today.

22:58.752 --> 22:59.753
Don't hang up.

23:00.629 --> 23:03.673
I dare you to hang up on me again.

23:03.757 --> 23:04.841
What if I do?

23:04.925 --> 23:06.009
I have…

23:06.510 --> 23:10.514
a knife to your wife's throat right now.

23:13.600 --> 23:14.935
I'll really kill her.

23:15.018 --> 23:15.894
Well?

23:16.978 --> 23:18.271
- I'll kill her.
- Okay.

23:19.147 --> 23:20.315
- Try it.
- What?

23:20.398 --> 23:22.400
Don't just talk about it, do it.

23:22.484 --> 23:23.485
Not yet…

23:24.736 --> 23:27.864
We haven't talked about money yet.

23:28.532 --> 23:30.033
How much will you…

23:31.827 --> 23:33.578
pay for the ransom?

23:35.330 --> 23:36.790
The ransom?

23:42.254 --> 23:43.421
Listen up.

23:44.339 --> 23:46.383
You can demand however much you want.

23:48.593 --> 23:51.096
But there will be no ransom.

23:52.055 --> 23:53.849
So don't call me again.

24:05.735 --> 24:06.778
Darn it.

24:24.379 --> 24:27.591
I seriously love this expression the most.

24:35.098 --> 24:36.391
Eyes on the road.

24:39.394 --> 24:42.105
Sis, do you get it now?

24:42.981 --> 24:45.942
That this isn't a joke?

24:47.027 --> 24:47.861
But…

24:48.653 --> 24:51.072
why does your husband think I'm joking?

24:51.156 --> 24:53.700
What the hell did he mean earlier?

24:53.783 --> 24:56.119
Why did he ask me
if I knew who his wife was?

24:56.203 --> 24:57.662
It's you, isn't it?

25:02.792 --> 25:06.046
Wait. Or does he have another wife?

25:09.132 --> 25:10.091
I'm just teasing.

25:11.051 --> 25:14.888
Well, it doesn't matter
if he has more than one wife.

25:15.513 --> 25:17.265
It's none of my business,

25:17.849 --> 25:21.102
but the wife Sa-eon cares about the most

25:21.937 --> 25:23.396
better be you, Sis.

25:24.147 --> 25:26.900
That's how you'll survive this.

25:29.778 --> 25:32.155
Now, let's call him again.

25:54.761 --> 25:56.721
PAIK SA-EON

25:57.555 --> 26:00.767
Is he going to ignore me again?

26:01.351 --> 26:02.185
Again?

26:05.522 --> 26:07.107
Paik Sa-eon!

26:07.190 --> 26:10.068
This bastard!

26:15.448 --> 26:17.284
It's okay. It's all good.

26:27.585 --> 26:28.461
Sis.

26:29.212 --> 26:32.549
Do you know what kind of phone this is?

26:33.675 --> 26:34.509
This…

26:35.385 --> 26:37.220
can only call Paik Sa-eon.

26:38.638 --> 26:40.640
The voice modulation
is also automatic.

26:40.724 --> 26:43.643
Also, it…

26:43.727 --> 26:44.978
What was it again?

26:46.062 --> 26:48.231
Yeah! That!

26:49.065 --> 26:51.026
It uses a VPN.

26:51.109 --> 26:53.111
It can't be tracked for ten minutes.

26:53.194 --> 26:55.530
I already prepped this car in advance too.

26:55.613 --> 26:57.282
That's why it moves on its own.

27:00.827 --> 27:02.620
I'm so well prepared.

27:02.704 --> 27:04.247
But this guy,

27:04.956 --> 27:07.542
Paik Sa-eon, isn't picking up the phone!

27:09.044 --> 27:09.961
PAIK SA-EON

27:11.421 --> 27:12.714
- Paik Sa-eon.
- What?

27:13.798 --> 27:16.051
Hello, just a moment.

27:16.134 --> 27:17.886
I'll put Mr. Paik on the phone.

27:17.969 --> 27:20.096
I told you not to answer it. Why did you?

27:20.180 --> 27:22.515
I pressed the button by mistake.

27:22.599 --> 27:24.309
It's a phishing scam.

27:25.977 --> 27:28.146
Listen up, you pathetic loser scumbag.

27:28.772 --> 27:31.316
What did I say?
I told you not to call me again.

27:31.399 --> 27:33.401
I'm sure I was clear too.

27:34.194 --> 27:36.112
I'm going to kill your wife.

27:37.739 --> 27:40.241
Fine, then hurry up and do it.

27:41.034 --> 27:41.868
And…

27:43.286 --> 27:46.164
Call me when there's a corpse.

28:07.227 --> 28:10.939
Call me when there's a corpse.

28:12.107 --> 28:15.652
Mr. Paik, Argan called through the hotline
and requests your presence.

28:18.196 --> 28:20.115
Don't touch my things.

28:20.198 --> 28:21.032
Yes, sir.

28:44.013 --> 28:46.015
What the hell? What are you doing?

28:49.811 --> 28:50.645
You crazy bitch!

28:53.231 --> 28:54.482
Damn it!

28:55.066 --> 28:57.026
Get your hands off it!

28:57.610 --> 28:58.445
Damn it!

29:00.488 --> 29:02.073
Stop the car!

29:20.925 --> 29:24.721
The government announced
at 6:55 p.m. today

29:24.804 --> 29:26.890
that negotiations successfully ended,

29:26.973 --> 29:31.686
and the Argan armed group
agreed to release all Korean hostages.

29:31.770 --> 29:34.856
Here is a statement
from spokesperson Paik Sa-eon.

29:34.939 --> 29:39.903
Thank you to the hostages and the public
for your trust and endurance

29:41.112 --> 29:46.910
and to the media for your cooperation
in ensuring national security and safety.

29:48.703 --> 29:50.580
We also express our gratitude

29:50.663 --> 29:53.583
to the Argan government
and allied international organizations,

29:54.167 --> 29:58.505
and we will take all necessary measures
to ensure the safe return of the hostages.

30:25.406 --> 30:27.784
Can I get an exclusive interview,
Mr. Paik?

30:27.867 --> 30:28.743
Just a moment.

30:28.827 --> 30:29.744
Wait.

30:29.828 --> 30:31.788
Wait! My arm! It's stuck!

30:32.539 --> 30:34.165
Come on, you darn punk!

30:34.749 --> 30:37.627
Why are you heading out so early?
It's not even 9:00 yet.

30:37.710 --> 30:38.711
Let's grab a drink.

30:39.587 --> 30:42.298
Did you wait to see
what time I clocked out?

30:42.382 --> 30:43.758
Are you a stalker?

30:44.551 --> 30:45.552
Yeah, man.

30:45.635 --> 30:47.971
I noticed you took down
all of my pictures.

30:48.054 --> 30:49.556
Why? Didn't like them?

30:49.639 --> 30:51.808
A journalist should report the truth.

30:51.891 --> 30:53.601
You shouldn't distort it.

30:53.685 --> 30:55.353
I didn't distort it. It's PR.

30:55.436 --> 30:56.437
Come on.

30:57.105 --> 30:59.649
- You lack humanity.
- I didn't ask you to do that.

30:59.732 --> 31:00.984
I never will, either.

31:01.067 --> 31:03.653
Hey, Sa-eon? Open the door. Hey!

31:03.736 --> 31:04.737
Stop… Hey!

31:05.446 --> 31:07.073
Hey, Sa-eon! Hey!

31:08.283 --> 31:09.701
Darn…

31:14.747 --> 31:15.582
What?

31:17.750 --> 31:18.585
What?

31:19.460 --> 31:22.088
Hey, what are you doing? Hey!

31:23.381 --> 31:24.382
Darn it.

31:25.842 --> 31:27.844
Hyeok-jin, I have a favor to ask.

31:35.727 --> 31:37.562
What's wrong with you? You're crazy!

31:41.566 --> 31:43.151
Hey, I'm sorry!

31:43.234 --> 31:44.903
I was wrong. I won't do it again.

31:44.986 --> 31:46.487
In front of us! There!

31:49.407 --> 31:51.492
Trace this number as quickly as possible.

31:51.576 --> 31:53.286
What? What is it?

31:53.369 --> 31:54.871
Hey, in front of us!

31:57.457 --> 31:59.792
It's a phishing scam,
but I have a bad feeling.

32:00.501 --> 32:02.670
A bad feeling? So do I.

32:02.754 --> 32:04.422
Slow down, man!

32:10.720 --> 32:14.182
I never assumed my number would be safe
from scammers.

32:16.184 --> 32:17.435
But a voice modulator?

32:17.518 --> 32:18.770
He's pulling out all the stops.

32:20.563 --> 32:22.398
So I just can't let it go.

32:22.482 --> 32:24.192
What? Phishing? Modulator?

32:24.776 --> 32:26.235
Is this a case?

32:26.945 --> 32:28.279
Just look into the number.

32:30.198 --> 32:32.283
406-000-1290?

32:37.455 --> 32:39.040
Get out. We're done.

32:40.416 --> 32:41.250
Okay.

32:42.043 --> 32:42.877
I'm off.

32:52.095 --> 32:52.971
Goodness.

32:53.596 --> 32:55.014
That punk.

32:55.098 --> 32:57.016
Why is he in such a hurry?

35:14.821 --> 35:15.738
You're alive.

35:20.451 --> 35:21.285
I received…

35:22.453 --> 35:24.580
a ridiculous phone call today.

35:25.498 --> 35:26.332
Someone said…

35:27.250 --> 35:29.085
they would kill you.

35:29.168 --> 35:32.421
Well, "my wife," to be exact.

35:36.384 --> 35:37.426
Anyway,

35:38.928 --> 35:40.346
you're alive and well.

35:46.936 --> 35:48.980
By the way, what's with the food?

35:49.063 --> 35:52.066
Didn't you have dinner with your mom?

36:02.618 --> 36:03.786
What happened?

36:05.538 --> 36:06.706
You can't trace it?

36:08.207 --> 36:09.709
It's not using the cell towers.

36:09.792 --> 36:11.544
We can't trace it with just a number.

36:16.048 --> 36:18.843
Hey, 406 is an area code in the States.

36:18.926 --> 36:20.636
And it's a virtual phone number.

36:21.971 --> 36:24.140
Is it because it's a virtual phone number?

36:24.223 --> 36:26.475
So is real-time tracking the only way?

36:26.559 --> 36:28.060
Yes, how did you know?

36:28.728 --> 36:31.480
And to track it in real time,
they have to call again.

36:35.026 --> 36:37.820
So I have to wait for his call?

36:37.904 --> 36:39.155
I'm sorry, sir.

36:39.739 --> 36:42.450
And the call must last
at least ten minutes.

36:42.533 --> 36:44.493
I'm sure you already know,

36:44.577 --> 36:46.537
but we need personal information
to identify--

36:46.621 --> 36:48.080
- It's a man.
- Sorry?

36:49.290 --> 36:50.708
But the voice was modulated.

36:50.791 --> 36:52.168
It's a man. I'm sure of it.

36:52.710 --> 36:55.004
And he was on drugs
or not in his right mind.

37:17.026 --> 37:20.905
He made the threatening call
at the perfect time.

37:20.988 --> 37:22.698
It was clear he was trying
to shake me up

37:22.782 --> 37:25.159
during a national emergency.

37:25.243 --> 37:29.455
Yes, there are many groups
that would be glad to see you fail.

37:30.248 --> 37:31.791
Is your wife okay?

37:33.542 --> 37:35.253
Of course, she's fine.

37:36.045 --> 37:38.839
But just in case,
I want her to be under protection.

37:38.923 --> 37:40.549
Without them knowing she's my wife.

37:40.633 --> 37:42.385
Okay. There's a team I can trust.

37:42.468 --> 37:45.721
I'll call them myself.
Just give me the number.

37:45.805 --> 37:46.847
Yes, sir.

37:46.931 --> 37:49.642
Also, about the event
at the British Embassy tomorrow,

37:49.725 --> 37:52.478
didn't you say we needed
a sign language interpreter?

37:53.104 --> 37:54.272
Did you find one?

38:03.864 --> 38:04.865
Come and sit.

38:22.591 --> 38:25.594
There's an event at the British Embassy
tomorrow at 6:00 p.m.

38:25.678 --> 38:28.347
I'll send someone
to pick you up by 5:00, so be ready.

38:30.933 --> 38:34.353
The ambassador's wife is deaf,
so we need a sign language interpreter.

38:34.437 --> 38:37.648
It's not a couple's event or anything.
Don't get the wrong idea.

38:46.574 --> 38:50.202
MOM

38:58.044 --> 38:58.878
MOM

39:02.548 --> 39:05.301
Where are you? Are you at home?
Why won't you pick up?

39:05.384 --> 39:07.136
Sa-eon was looking for you earlier.

39:07.845 --> 39:11.932
WHY WAS HE LOOKING FOR ME?

39:13.851 --> 39:16.145
I don't know.
He asked me if I was with you.

39:16.228 --> 39:19.690
I said I'd send you home after dinner,
so tell him so when he comes home.

39:21.192 --> 39:23.069
MOM

39:25.279 --> 39:27.615
MOM

39:27.698 --> 39:29.116
You listen to me.

39:29.200 --> 39:31.744
There's just a month left
until the presidential campaign.

39:32.495 --> 39:34.663
You probably won't need to show yourself,

39:34.747 --> 39:38.292
but just in case, see the dermatologist
and plastic surgeon starting tomorrow.

39:38.918 --> 39:40.002
And another thing.

39:42.755 --> 39:44.340
When did you stop going to the clinic?

39:45.383 --> 39:47.259
No wonder why you're not pregnant!

39:47.343 --> 39:50.388
I'll send the medicine tomorrow,
so be ready to get in shape.

39:50.846 --> 39:51.764
Are you listening?

39:54.475 --> 39:58.062
I can't tell if you're listening
since you're completely silent.

39:58.145 --> 40:00.648
It's just a month left.

40:01.899 --> 40:03.567
I told you to quit your job.

40:46.610 --> 40:49.029
3 YEARS AGO

40:51.323 --> 40:52.158
Take it off.

40:53.325 --> 40:55.828
It doesn't belong to you.
You're just the stand-in.

40:56.704 --> 40:57.538
Take it off.

41:00.875 --> 41:03.085
The wedding will be held in private.

41:03.961 --> 41:07.965
You'll never have to pretend
to be my wife in front of others again.

41:29.236 --> 41:30.905
Are you going to strip naked?

41:41.832 --> 41:43.626
It's our wedding vows.

41:49.840 --> 41:52.301
You don't have to read it all,
just remember this.

41:52.384 --> 41:55.137
One, the bride cannot initiate a divorce.

41:55.221 --> 41:58.057
Two, especially
not during the election period.

41:58.140 --> 42:02.394
Three, you will not publicly disclose
your name or face as Paik Sa-eon's wife.

42:02.478 --> 42:06.106
If any of these is violated,
the penalty will be two billion won.

42:20.871 --> 42:21.830
Get up.

42:23.123 --> 42:24.208
I said, get up.

42:31.048 --> 42:32.007
You're so stubborn.

42:43.227 --> 42:45.229
Forget the illusion that we're married.

42:48.065 --> 42:49.066
You were sent…

42:50.484 --> 42:51.944
as a hostage to me.

43:04.290 --> 43:05.666
PAIK SA-EON'S MARRIAGE

43:05.749 --> 43:08.919
SPOKESPERSON PAIK'S WEDDING
SUDDENLY TURNED PRIVATE

43:11.088 --> 43:16.093
SOME SAY THE WEDDING WAS HELD IN PRIVATE
TO HIDE THE BRIDE FROM THE PUBLIC

43:31.358 --> 43:34.445
SIGN IS A LANGUAGE
SEONGNANG-GU SIGN LANGUAGE CENTER

43:41.368 --> 43:44.288
Come on, asshole! Come at me!

43:44.371 --> 43:45.372
Come!

43:46.457 --> 43:49.960
Come at me if you have a death wish!
You bastards!

43:50.044 --> 43:51.629
Who is it at this hour?

43:51.712 --> 43:53.756
STUDIO
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

43:55.132 --> 43:56.050
We meet again.

43:57.343 --> 43:58.260
Goodness.

43:58.344 --> 44:00.220
What is that?

44:00.304 --> 44:03.223
Didn't I tell you not to run your mouth?

44:03.307 --> 44:04.224
What's she doing?

44:04.308 --> 44:05.684
Do you want to lose your teeth?

44:06.852 --> 44:09.647
You must have a death wish, bastard.
Eyes down!

44:09.730 --> 44:10.898
Hee-joo?

44:12.733 --> 44:13.651
What are you doing?

44:15.736 --> 44:16.945
I was just practicing.

44:17.863 --> 44:20.783
What kind of intense practice is this?

44:20.866 --> 44:22.910
Are you interpreting for the police?

44:22.993 --> 44:26.246
Or did a loan shark ask
for an interpreter? Is the debtor deaf?

44:26.330 --> 44:27.539
It's not like that.

44:27.623 --> 44:29.333
But you've never done this before.

44:29.416 --> 44:31.210
You really startled me.

44:31.293 --> 44:32.795
You scared me.

44:32.878 --> 44:35.255
Just do what you usually do.

44:35.339 --> 44:37.341
Watch the video you practice with.

44:40.386 --> 44:41.804
The one with Paik Sa-eon.

44:43.347 --> 44:46.558
There have been a lot of briefings lately.
Want me to bring you some?

44:47.226 --> 44:48.811
No, I don't need them.

44:49.395 --> 44:50.312
Why not?

44:51.063 --> 44:54.191
You said you liked his videos
because they're like a textbook.

44:54.274 --> 44:56.735
You said you wanted to be on-screen

44:56.819 --> 44:59.780
with Paik Sa-eon
even if it was just a brief moment.

45:00.656 --> 45:05.536
I'm done with Paik Sa-eon's videos.
I've done enough already.

45:40.737 --> 45:41.655
I apologize.

45:42.406 --> 45:43.574
I'm sorry we're late.

45:44.616 --> 45:45.534
It's fine.

46:00.883 --> 46:01.717
Let's go.

46:49.765 --> 46:51.475
Wow. That's so nice.

47:30.097 --> 47:34.101
I didn't know
the spokesperson's wife could sign.

47:34.184 --> 47:37.062
I'm not the spokesperson's wife.

47:38.021 --> 47:44.236
I'm just here as an interpreter.
There's no personal relationship.

48:10.887 --> 48:12.014
To be honest,

48:12.723 --> 48:14.433
my wife has a disability too.

48:29.948 --> 48:31.241
Because my wife…

48:34.870 --> 48:35.787
…is my weakness.

48:43.670 --> 48:46.465
I face attacks from all sides.

48:46.548 --> 48:50.260
In a way, you could say
I'm the government's official scapegoat.

48:50.969 --> 48:51.845
So I don't want

48:53.013 --> 48:56.141
my wife to be exposed
to indiscriminate attacks like I am.

48:57.976 --> 49:00.479
Yes, she's my weakness.

49:20.248 --> 49:21.583
TEXT MESSAGE

49:23.460 --> 49:24.711
We're on standby.

49:24.795 --> 49:26.546
We can track it once you get the call,

49:26.630 --> 49:28.215
so just be mindful of the time.

49:46.191 --> 49:47.651
Are you trying to get drunk?

49:49.403 --> 49:50.654
Or are you already drunk?

50:00.205 --> 50:01.957
I'LL GO HOME IF I'M DONE HERE

50:02.040 --> 50:02.999
You can't.

50:05.752 --> 50:08.338
You just have to stand quietly next to me.

50:08.422 --> 50:09.339
Is that so hard?

50:12.134 --> 50:12.968
Stay.

50:15.220 --> 50:17.681
Go sit somewhere if your legs hurt.
Stop drinking.

50:26.231 --> 50:29.359
Do you think I can't hear
just because I can't speak?

50:30.736 --> 50:34.239
Do you think I can't feel emotions?

50:36.450 --> 50:38.577
You don't want to expose me
to indiscriminate attacks?

50:39.202 --> 50:42.497
Then why am I hurt and torn apart already?

50:45.000 --> 50:47.002
Did you say I was your weakness?

50:47.085 --> 50:49.463
A weakness…

50:50.505 --> 50:52.382
is a wound that's prone to infection.

50:52.466 --> 50:54.134
When someone touches it, you flinch,

50:54.217 --> 50:56.094
tremble, and desperately defend it.

50:56.178 --> 50:57.554
That's a weakness.

50:58.930 --> 51:00.807
But you didn't act like that yesterday.

51:02.309 --> 51:04.978
You despicable jerk.

51:06.688 --> 51:09.649
Did you just curse at me?

51:21.536 --> 51:23.330
But then, I might not be the wife

51:23.413 --> 51:25.373
you were just talking about.

52:42.450 --> 52:43.368
Hello?

52:51.918 --> 52:53.336
Speak, 406.

52:58.508 --> 52:59.634
Should I go first?

53:01.595 --> 53:03.847
My wife is safe.

53:04.973 --> 53:06.558
Did you fail to kill her?

53:08.059 --> 53:09.394
Why won't you speak?

53:10.020 --> 53:11.479
You went on and on yesterday.

53:12.355 --> 53:13.189
Wait.

53:14.024 --> 53:17.360
I didn't have time
to listen to your rambling.

53:25.744 --> 53:29.915
Then let's hear your plan on how
you're going to hurt her in the future.

53:30.916 --> 53:33.752
I've got plenty of free time today.

53:35.837 --> 53:36.755
True,

53:36.838 --> 53:39.633
I guess there's not much to do at a party.

53:41.134 --> 53:42.969
I'm glad you're having a good time.

53:43.595 --> 53:46.222
You're good
at playing the lovestruck fool.

53:48.642 --> 53:50.602
Are you surprised by how close I am?

53:53.021 --> 53:53.855
Yeah.

53:54.522 --> 53:57.859
I've been watching you the whole time,
but you didn't notice.

53:58.485 --> 54:00.487
- Stop bluffing.
- Bluffing?

54:01.237 --> 54:03.031
How could someone like you get in here?

54:03.698 --> 54:05.283
You need an invitation to--

54:05.367 --> 54:07.202
You've hardly eaten anything.

54:08.203 --> 54:09.204
Eat something.

54:09.287 --> 54:12.248
The bruschetta with the truffle on top
was really good.

54:29.766 --> 54:30.767
Who are you?

54:33.395 --> 54:36.773
Are you curious about me now?

54:36.856 --> 54:38.942
Stop laughing and answer me. Who are you?

54:40.235 --> 54:41.236
How did you get in here?

54:41.820 --> 54:43.113
Yeah, I'll answer you.

54:43.822 --> 54:46.116
The answer to the question
you asked earlier.

54:51.371 --> 54:52.580
You asked me…

54:54.457 --> 54:56.876
how I plan on hurting your wife.

55:00.088 --> 55:01.172
Don't mess around.

55:01.840 --> 55:03.883
How dare you come here?

55:05.802 --> 55:07.762
You look flustered.

55:07.846 --> 55:09.723
You should've done this yesterday.

55:50.972 --> 55:51.806
Who are you?

55:52.891 --> 55:53.850
What are you doing?

55:53.975 --> 55:55.018
Hello?

55:55.101 --> 55:57.020
What's wrong? Did something happen?

55:57.729 --> 55:58.563
I apologize.

56:02.817 --> 56:05.820
What was that? You're way off base.

56:05.904 --> 56:08.448
You said I can't be possibly here.

56:08.531 --> 56:11.451
A loser like you is probably hiding
and snickering in your room.

56:11.534 --> 56:16.164
Do you really think someone like you
could do anything to my wife?

56:17.791 --> 56:21.461
Listen up, if you wanted to threaten me,
you chose the wrong hostage.

56:21.544 --> 56:23.338
My wife? Who's my wife?

56:23.421 --> 56:24.672
Have you even seen her?

56:24.756 --> 56:28.009
Yeah, that's right.
The world has no idea who she is.

56:28.093 --> 56:30.470
They don't know who your real wife is.

56:30.553 --> 56:31.930
But I do.

56:32.680 --> 56:33.848
Hong Hee-joo

56:34.599 --> 56:36.601
isn't your real wife.

56:41.397 --> 56:46.152
Your real wife is the one you were
supposed to marry, your real fiancée.

56:47.570 --> 56:51.157
The eldest daughter of the chairman
of Chungwoon Daily News, Hong In-a.

56:52.075 --> 56:56.996
She ran away the day before the wedding,
and I heard no one knows where she is.

56:58.081 --> 56:59.916
But still,

56:59.999 --> 57:03.545
how could you marry her sister instead?

57:04.212 --> 57:05.672
Isn't that outrageous?

57:07.090 --> 57:10.260
But then,
Chungwoon Daily News and your family

57:10.343 --> 57:12.720
are in an inseparable
symbiotic relationship.

57:12.804 --> 57:17.559
You had to go through with the marriage,
so you married her sister as a hostage?

57:17.642 --> 57:20.728
Either way, I bet people
will love that. Right?

57:20.812 --> 57:22.272
It's so shocking.

57:22.355 --> 57:26.151
Paik Sa-eon,
the clean and great spokesperson,

57:26.234 --> 57:28.403
rides both sisters like an elevator.

57:28.486 --> 57:31.531
On and off whenever he wants.

57:36.453 --> 57:38.580
What's wrong? Cat got your tongue?

57:39.164 --> 57:42.250
Don't you want to know how I know
a secret nobody else knows?

57:43.960 --> 57:45.753
Say something, Paik Sa-eon!

57:47.589 --> 57:49.007
What do you want?

57:49.090 --> 57:50.967
Yeah, good job.

57:51.593 --> 57:53.178
That's the correct answer.

57:57.140 --> 57:58.308
Tell me…

57:59.851 --> 58:01.102
what you want.

58:02.687 --> 58:04.063
Then listen carefully.

58:04.689 --> 58:07.567
I'm going to tell you my demands now.

58:11.529 --> 58:12.822
Get rid of Hong Hee-joo

58:13.448 --> 58:15.033
and get back with your real fiancée.

58:16.117 --> 58:20.371
You don't need Hong Hee-joo
in your life anyway, do you?

58:38.097 --> 58:40.808
Listen up, you pathetic loser scumbag.

58:40.892 --> 58:43.603
What did I say?
I told you not to call me again.

58:43.686 --> 58:45.772
I'm sure I was clear too.

58:46.981 --> 58:48.775
I'm going to kill your wife.

58:48.858 --> 58:50.151
Then hurry up and do it.

58:50.902 --> 58:51.903
And…

58:52.820 --> 58:56.032
Call me when there's a corpse.

59:18.680 --> 59:19.847
That asshole.

59:25.520 --> 59:26.980
Call him back.

59:27.063 --> 59:28.189
What?

59:29.065 --> 59:32.527
I have something to say to him,
so call him back now!

59:44.372 --> 59:45.415
This is exhilarating.

59:53.548 --> 59:54.382
Pick up.

59:56.342 --> 59:57.427
Pick up.

59:57.510 --> 01:00:00.013
Pick up!

01:00:01.347 --> 01:00:02.765
Pick up!

01:00:51.314 --> 01:00:52.315
Do you understand?

01:00:52.398 --> 01:00:56.235
Unless you want your personal life
to ruin your father's election,

01:00:56.319 --> 01:00:57.612
return things to what they were.

01:00:57.695 --> 01:01:00.990
If you don't,
I'll expose the secrets of your marriage.

01:01:08.623 --> 01:01:11.000
Hey, man. Are you scared?

01:01:13.002 --> 01:01:17.006
It's funny Paik Sa-eon would be scared
because of a loser like me.

01:01:27.684 --> 01:01:29.143
You have until tomorrow to decide.

01:01:29.227 --> 01:01:31.938
Or we can settle for two billion won.
You have until tomorrow.

01:01:33.690 --> 01:01:34.774
Are you done?

01:01:45.743 --> 01:01:46.744
Tell me,

01:01:47.912 --> 01:01:51.708
how do punks like you
never change your repertoire?

01:01:53.084 --> 01:01:54.001
What?

01:01:54.085 --> 01:01:55.795
If you want to threaten me,

01:01:55.878 --> 01:01:57.547
you should study up on me first.

01:01:58.923 --> 01:02:00.633
There are hundreds of reporters

01:02:00.717 --> 01:02:02.468
eager to get me to speak at any cost.

01:02:03.344 --> 01:02:05.972
Turning a lame scandal into fake news
is easy for me.

01:02:06.556 --> 01:02:09.934
And I can get rid of
a pathetic blackmailer with my eyes shut.

01:02:10.727 --> 01:02:11.811
So why would I?

01:02:14.480 --> 01:02:17.191
Why did you think
I'd accept the presumptuous demand

01:02:17.275 --> 01:02:18.568
to abandon Hong Hee-joo?

01:02:19.777 --> 01:02:23.990
Why are you dragging my person into this?

01:02:26.159 --> 01:02:28.494
"My person"?

01:02:29.203 --> 01:02:30.872
Don't be ridiculous!

01:02:32.415 --> 01:02:36.419
Hey, do you know what happened
to your precious person yesterday?

01:02:36.502 --> 01:02:37.587
She almost died.

01:02:37.670 --> 01:02:40.715
No, I mean, I almost killed her!

01:02:40.798 --> 01:02:44.552
I kidnapped her in her car,
choked her, and grabbed her by the hair.

01:02:44.635 --> 01:02:47.680
I had a knife to her.
I was going to kill her. Do you get it?

01:02:48.639 --> 01:02:49.474
So?

01:02:50.767 --> 01:02:53.686
What do you mean? It was scary.

01:02:53.770 --> 01:02:55.605
She was terrified!

01:02:57.523 --> 01:02:59.859
So she was scared. What happened next?

01:03:00.485 --> 01:03:04.197
I was about to kill her,
and she couldn't even beg for her life.

01:03:04.280 --> 01:03:06.365
Since she can't speak.

01:03:08.326 --> 01:03:09.160
Then?

01:03:09.827 --> 01:03:14.415
Then you ruthlessly hung up the phone,
saying to call when there's a corpse!

01:03:14.499 --> 01:03:17.210
Yeah, Hong Hee-joo
really could've ended up dead.

01:03:17.293 --> 01:03:19.295
The car rolled on the slippery road!

01:03:26.969 --> 01:03:28.721
I've never been…

01:03:30.014 --> 01:03:32.558
more curious about a man before.

01:03:39.357 --> 01:03:41.859
Forget about getting arrested, 406.

01:03:43.653 --> 01:03:45.321
I promise,

01:03:47.073 --> 01:03:48.658
I'm going to catch you.

01:04:07.552 --> 01:04:08.553
Wait…

01:04:09.428 --> 01:04:12.682
Am I screwed, or did he fall for it?

01:04:53.931 --> 01:04:56.851
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

01:04:57.602 --> 01:04:58.561
Who was he?

01:04:59.186 --> 01:05:00.521
Did you see his face?

01:05:01.230 --> 01:05:02.189
Paik Sa-eon is scared.

01:05:03.524 --> 01:05:04.400
What is this?

01:05:04.483 --> 01:05:07.236
It's Hong Hee-joo's thigh.

01:05:07.987 --> 01:05:09.488
Have you never seen her naked?

01:05:10.156 --> 01:05:11.741
I must be crazy!

01:05:11.824 --> 01:05:13.993
What the heck? Why is he coming?

01:05:14.994 --> 01:05:16.871
Hee-joo, you're doing well, right?

01:05:18.039 --> 01:05:19.624
A man?

01:05:19.707 --> 01:05:20.625
Were you close?

01:05:21.918 --> 01:05:24.462
Lately, nothing makes sense.

01:05:25.129 --> 01:05:27.590
There can't be a Hong Hee-joo
I don't know about.

01:05:27.673 --> 01:05:28.716
By any chance,

01:05:30.134 --> 01:05:31.969
are you close to me?

01:05:35.014 --> 01:05:38.017
Subtitle translation by: Sue Mounce
